Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.52,0:00:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Space has a beginning, but it has no end.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.61,0:00:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Infinite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.15,0:00:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Stars too have a beginning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.03,0:00:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,but are by their own power destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.33,0:00:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Finite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.66,0:00:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,History dictates that he who holds wisdom is the greatest fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This could be called God's final warning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.22,0:00:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,to those that still rebel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.06,0:00:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
