Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.76,0:01:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Initiating building infiltration.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.67,0:01:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,El Psy Kongroo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.68,0:01:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There aren't many people here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.18,0:01:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,As I suspected. This reeks of Organization interference...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.35,0:01:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going to happen here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.48,0:01:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You came along without even knowing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.32,0:01:37.99,SignA,,0,0,0,,{\frx2\fry0\fscx51.25\fscy96.25\frz359.463\move(459,142.5,760.5,150,0,1648)}Doctor Nakabachi's Time Machine Invention Press Conference
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.32,0:01:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A time machine...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.99,0:01:38.66,SignA,,0,0,0,,{\frx2\fry0\fscx51.25\fscy96.25\frz359.463\move(769.5,150,840,151.5,0,655)}Doctor Nakabachi's Time Machine Invention Press Conference
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.99,0:01:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.66,0:01:39.66,SignA,,0,0,0,,{\frx2\fry0\fscx51.25\fscy96.25\frz359.463\move(844.5,151.5,879,153,0,610)}Doctor Nakabachi's Time Machine Invention Press Conference
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.16,0:01:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor Nakabachi has done what the rest of us could not,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.24,0:01:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and he's here today to announce the invention of the century.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.17,0:01:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be paying careful attention to what he has to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.09,0:01:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,An earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.55,0:01:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No, from above?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.56,0:02:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.57,0:02:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You called me here for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.74,0:02:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There aren't many left of this series,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.58,0:02:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and Mayushii's out of 100 yen coins!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't act so spoiled, Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.17,0:02:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you're my childhood friend, I won't loan you any money.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.51,0:02:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you how harsh life can be...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.90,0:02:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.56,0:02:54.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not painted?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.44,0:02:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,M-Metal...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.07,0:02:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a metal...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.40,0:03:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,A metal Upa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.07,0:03:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it rare?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.49,0:03:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Extremely!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.20,0:03:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you can have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.62,0:03:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure, Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.17,0:03:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Hououin Kyouma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.04,0:03:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Okarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.59,0:03:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I said it's Hououin Kyouma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.88,0:03:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor Nakabachi's press conference
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.22,0:03:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,will now begin in the 8th floor's hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,In the handouts, I have outlined
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.23,0:03:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,the time machine's basic design.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.94,0:03:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I will use this conference as an opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.98,0:03:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,to discuss the fundamental theory behind it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.90,0:03:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Scientists all over the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:44.82,SignB,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.8\fscx176.25\fscy185\org(1233,173)\pos(1212,192)\frz18.998\fax0.2\frx12\fry358}Received Mail
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:44.82,SignC,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\fscx167.5\fscy136.25\org(1073,369)\frx20\fry358\pos(1134,376.5)\frz18.475\fax.05}Time:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:44.82,SignC,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\fscx143.75\fscy143.75\frz18.567\frx6\fry4\pos(1480.5,429)\fax.15}Sender: Mayuri
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:44.82,SignC,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\fscx143.75\fscy143.75\frz18.844\frx10\fry0\pos(1534.5,559.5)\fax.15}Subject: My Upa...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,"I think I dropped my metal Upa,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.28,0:03:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,so I'm going to look for it."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.74,0:03:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Currently, there are more than ten major theories in regards to possible methods of time travel,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.16,0:03:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Basic design of the time machine...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.95,0:03:56.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}and they've been examined from nearly every possible angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.38,0:04:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.72,0:04:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You know exactly what it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.43,0:04:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this "time machine theory" of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.60,0:04:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Kerr black holes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.06,0:04:10.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Worldlines?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.39,0:04:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all taken directly from John Titor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.81,0:04:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Titor called himself a time traveler,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.56,0:04:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and posted this theory on the Internet back in 2000.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.57,0:04:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't attempt to feign ignorance!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.28,0:04:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.07,0:04:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I know about him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.99,0:04:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't compare my theory to that fraud's!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.12,0:04:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you explain
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.95,0:04:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the differences between your theories?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.67,0:04:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Titor, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.75,0:04:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, there was
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.71,0:04:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,some similar stuff in the John Titor books...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.72,0:04:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what I'd like to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.35,0:04:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.18,0:04:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Back there, you were going to tell me something,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.64,0:04:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.35,0:04:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.56,0:04:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,About fifteen minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.27,0:05:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have the slightest idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.98,0:05:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Makise... Kurisu?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.49,0:05:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You had a paper in "Science Magazine" a while ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.37,0:05:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised you know of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.28,0:05:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a university scientist?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.54,0:05:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.58,0:05:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you an agent of The Organization?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.54,0:05:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Organization?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.83,0:05:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.46,0:05:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to ask you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.88,0:05:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need for me to answer you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.26,0:05:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.17,0:05:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been caught by an Organization agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.18,0:05:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.76,0:05:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Makise Kurisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.30,0:05:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Who are you talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.39,0:05:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it should be no trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.10,0:05:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get out of this somehow...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.97,0:05:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? It's turned off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.77,0:05:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.69,0:05:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a special cell phone for secret missions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.95,0:05:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone but me touches it, it deactivates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.91,0:05:52.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.53,0:05:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You were talking to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.04,0:05:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make this brief.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.91,0:05:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you going to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.92,0:06:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,About fifteen minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.84,0:06:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You were trying to tell me something, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.30,0:06:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It seemed like it was really important...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen through your tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.64,0:06:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Genius Girl, when next we meet, we will be enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.68,0:06:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.52,0:06:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.90,0:06:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What was she talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.36,0:06:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,She met me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.83,0:06:37.08,SignC2,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fsp3\frx2\fry0\frz5.324\t(70,250,\fscx73\fscy78)\move(586.5,631.5,585,633,65,232)\fscx72.5\fscy77.5}Date: 2010/07/28 12:26 \NSender: sg-epk@jtk92.x29.jp \NSubject: (No Subject) \NAttachment: IMV001
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.83,0:06:37.08,SignB2,,0,0,0,,{\fsp-3\be2\frx0\fry16\frz5.11\t(75,250,\fscx101\fscy101)\move(1128,213,1129.5,211.5,65,232)}Received Mail
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.92,0:06:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.22,0:06:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.47,0:06:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.89,0:06:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I messaged you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.22,0:06:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find my metal Upa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.81,0:06:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I even put my name on it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.39,0:06:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You dropped it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.68,0:07:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.64,0:07:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.06,0:07:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,On auction sites, a metal Upa goes for 10,000 yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.15,0:07:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,10,000 yen...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.28,0:07:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.78,0:07:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My lab is almost entirely out of funding!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.45,0:07:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I find it, I won't sell it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.50,0:07:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,With 10,000 yen, we could acquire the parts
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.00,0:07:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,for a new future gadget...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.75,0:07:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I'm not selling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.59,0:07:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.55,0:07:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.57,0:07:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.62,0:07:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Is someone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.01,0:08:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Makise Kurisu...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.85,0:08:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.52,0:08:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's been stabbed...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.58,0:08:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.67,0:08:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.33,0:08:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pale.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.59,0:08:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw a corpse...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.21,0:08:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,On the 8th floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:10.65,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fscx135\fscy137.5\pos(264,1023)\frz15.962\frx0\fry0}Looks like someone stabbed Makise Kurisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:10.65,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(705,94.5)\be2\fscx135\fscy137.5\frz15.482\frx2\fry0}To:{\c&HFCFAFA&} Daru
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:10.65,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fscx135\fscy137.5\frz15.974\c&HA19899&\pos(936,396)\frx358\fry358}Subject: {\c&HFBF3F7&}Trouble
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.65,0:09:11.44,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\be2\frz15.262\fscx181.25\fscy171.25\pos(855,573)\c&H686363&}Send?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.38,0:09:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.40,0:09:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.47,0:09:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Tutturu~
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.44,0:09:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.45,0:10:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.99,0:10:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.49,0:10:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The people... Why did all the people disappear?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.12,0:10:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.79,0:10:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,They all disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.75,0:10:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,All the people here! They were right in front of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.13,0:10:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.13,0:10:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.04,0:10:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw it, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.00,0:10:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.21,0:10:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.76,0:10:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about...
