Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.75,0:12:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you see us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.21,0:12:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.13,0:12:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You, on the other side of the monitor, with the vacant expression!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.80,0:12:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.63,0:12:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the Future Gadget Laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.47,0:12:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll introduce our staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.89,0:12:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,First up is Lab Mem 001.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.77,0:12:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the lab's founder and an insane mad scientist...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.23,0:12:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It is none other than I, Hououin Kyouma!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.98,0:12:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin sounds much cuter though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.61,0:12:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.40,0:12:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe Rintaro is the name I use to deceive the public eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.57,0:12:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Next up Lab Mem 002.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.95,0:12:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the lab's lone female member, and her hobby is making cosplay outfits.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.41,0:12:43.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Shiina Mayuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.87,0:12:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me, Mayushii.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.25,0:12:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And finally, Lab Mem 003, Supah Hakah Hashida Itaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.09,0:12:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's "Hacker," not "Hakah," duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.80,0:12:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.59,0:13:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it about time to give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.01,0:13:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't expect too much from software you got out of a 500 yen bargain bin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.06,0:13:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.89,0:13:17.11,SignE,,0,0,0,,{\be2\c&H767873&\3c&H767873&\move(592.5,172.5,592.5,555,0,10198)}Future {\3c&H4A4B46&\c&H656661&}Gadget {\c&H4B4D4A&}Laboratory
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.89,0:13:17.11,SignH,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fscx91.25\fscy93.75\c&H76796F&\move(841.5,1063.5,841.5,1221,0,4317)}CRT\N TV
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.89,0:13:17.11,SignH,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fscx97.5\fscy96.25\move(1179,1056,1179,1212,0,4109)}Work-\Nshop
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.43,0:13:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,To get to our lab go down Chuo Street,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:10.06,0:13:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,turn left on Kuramae Street.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.65,0:13:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,at the Suehirochou intersection
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.44,0:13:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in a multi-use building, in the first alley
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.86,0:13:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,before the traffic light.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.65,0:13:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The goal of the Future Gadget Laboratory
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.57,0:13:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,is to reform the ruling structure of the world...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.03,0:13:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,To create inventions which will bring about chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.91,0:13:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.87,0:13:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If you understand, then tell me your secrets!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.50,0:13:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you think we look
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.29,0:13:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,like a video game to Alpacaman?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.30,0:13:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think the concept of what's real and fantasy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.80,0:13:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,is a little beyond him?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.76,0:13:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then are your 2D girls like that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.68,0:13:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That's different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.14,0:13:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are mai waifu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.27,0:13:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody cares about your wives.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.85,0:13:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But isn't that an interesting idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.52,0:13:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If we did exist solely inside a monitor,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.94,0:14:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,do you think there would be any way we could tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.53,0:14:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.90,0:14:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That was fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.45,0:14:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thus, this discussion is pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.62,0:14:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We'd do much better to spend our time
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.91,0:14:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,thinking of ways to battle The Organization
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.58,0:14:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and destroy the world's ruling structure.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.79,0:14:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That delusional crap again? Fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.75,0:14:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence, Supah Hakah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.63,0:14:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the Insane Mad Scientist, Hououin...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.76,0:14:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.39,0:14:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your backstory, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.85,0:14:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,My, my, Daru.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.31,0:14:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't go hiding in your shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.85,0:14:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You should listen to what others have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.56,0:14:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So, this is today's "you're the last one I want to hear that from" thread?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.36,0:14:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it looks like the news helicopter has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.73,0:14:47.12,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\be2\b1\bord4.5\c&HE6E3F0&\3c&H372DA3&\fscx55\fscy72.5\pos(51,837)}Special Report
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.73,0:14:47.12,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\be2\fscx60\fscy46.25\c&H505192&\pos(1192.5,921)}Where did it come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.73,0:14:47.12,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\be2\bord3\fscx60\fscy46.25\c&HB9C9C9&\3c&H505A58&\pos(1194,961.5)}A mysterious satellite appears!!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.73,0:14:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The object, thought to be some sort of satellite, crashed in Akihabara, Tokyo,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.57,0:14:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,around 12 o'clock today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.91,0:14:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.83,0:14:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,This morning, Mayuri and I left the lab for Radio Kaikan,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.67,0:15:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,to attend Doctor Nakabachi's press conference.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.30,0:15:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But the next thing I knew, a satellite had crashed into the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.22,0:15:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And not just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.60,0:15:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.89,0:15:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah... You saw the satellite crash on TV and said,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.31,0:15:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,"The Organization has finally made its move!"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.73,0:15:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So the two of us went over to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.86,0:15:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Canceled?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.90,0:15:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember how angry
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.36,0:15:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,you were this morning? You said something like, "He got cold feet and ran away!"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.16,0:15:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor Nakabachi's press conference!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.28,0:15:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It was at 12 o'clock, at Radio Kaikan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.37,0:15:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It really wasn't, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.29,0:15:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And a good thing too...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.50,0:15:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If it had been, that satellite would have smashed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.71,0:15:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This discrepancy in memories...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.92,0:15:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it The Organization's memory control?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.59,0:15:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.55,0:15:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the choice of Steins Gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.10,0:15:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.06,0:15:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That Stein-whatever doesn't make any sense at all, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.27,0:16:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru, get me Future Gadget #1!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.40,0:16:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Alpacaman got mad because you changed the channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.83,0:16:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse you, Mr. Braun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.20,0:16:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Making us use this piece of crap...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.79,0:16:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He gave it to us for free, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.83,0:16:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru, get the TV!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.42,0:16:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.38,0:16:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty hot today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.34,0:16:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And like,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.17,0:16:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,don't think I'm strong just 'cause I'm fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.18,0:16:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not something to brag about!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.18,0:16:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Braun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.77,0:16:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to call me Tennouji.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.31,0:16:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to ask you to fix this immediately...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.15,0:16:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You broke it already?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.69,0:16:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have enough love for the Braun tubes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.61,0:16:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,1,000 yen to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.20,0:16:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone's at fault here, wouldn't it be you, for giving us something defective?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.87,0:16:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Is that how you address your landlord?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.08,0:16:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pay the repair bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.33,0:17:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri, you should give up on this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.96,0:17:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But Mayushii is Okarin's hostage!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.38,0:17:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hostage, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.76,0:17:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this broken as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.34,0:17:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Repair bill's 2,000 yen now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.18,0:17:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't like it, take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.81,0:17:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What will you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.56,0:17:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.06,0:17:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The Organization has finally gained control of the bald man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.61,0:17:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm encountering sabotage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.44,0:17:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.49,0:17:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You really do like Dr Pepper, Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.04,0:17:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an intellectual drink for the chosen ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.43,0:17:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The cicadas are really loud, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.27,0:18:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.19,0:18:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that the Organization
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.23,0:18:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,has begun using Mr. Braun to sabotage us, we're putting the plan into action.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.44,0:18:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been backed into a corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.36,0:18:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan? The what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.86,0:18:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The plan is the plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.32,0:18:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What else could it be but the introduction of
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.66,0:18:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Future Gadget #8 to an actual combat situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.45,0:18:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the PhoneWave (name subject to change).
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.41,0:18:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you use a microwave in combat, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.46,0:18:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been nearly three and a half years since we met.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.84,0:18:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Second year of high school...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.46,0:18:30.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We were in different classes and barely spoke,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.88,0:18:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,so it's more like two years?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.34,0:18:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The details don't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.72,0:18:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, it's been that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.39,0:18:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please reach the point
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.14,0:18:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,where you can keep up with my conversations already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.60,0:18:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That is-n't...hap-pen-ing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.31,0:18:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, want to try again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.15,0:18:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.90,0:18:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri, bring the bananas!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.86,0:18:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're making gel-banas again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.82,0:18:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's such a waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.15,0:18:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,If we're stingy, we can never succeed against The Organization!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.45,0:18:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't need to win...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.41,0:19:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Mayushii's the one bringing bananas, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.04,0:19:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.75,0:19:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is R-E-N-G, the PhoneWave (name subject to change).
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.96,0:19:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You can manipulate the timer from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.59,0:19:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please press the pound key,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.34,0:19:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and then enter the number of seconds you want to cook for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.26,0:19:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,One, two, zero, pound.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.89,0:19:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Pretty turntable, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.43,0:19:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It goes in the opposite direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.23,0:19:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Opposite?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.81,0:19:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Might be important!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.19,0:19:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,When you think of what's happening at the quantum level,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.98,0:19:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and you apply Hund's rules...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.28,0:19:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it... isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.24,0:19:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.07,0:19:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.12,0:19:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.83,0:19:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't get warm, and it doesn't get cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.25,0:19:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii's Juicy Chicken Number 1 froze...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.96,0:19:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, something involving Steins Gate is at work here, that much is clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.46,0:19:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.84,0:19:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru, don't you want to try eating this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.97,0:19:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.22,0:20:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll give the honor to Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.22,0:20:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The gel-bana was soft and squishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.56,0:20:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And it had no taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.68,0:20:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You ate it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.81,0:20:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.65,0:20:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, "Your banana is soft and squishy."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.40,0:20:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,"Your banana is soft—"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.07,0:20:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make her say that, you pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.12,0:20:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm melting...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.08,0:20:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It hasn't been ten minutes since we left the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.37,0:20:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,When it gets hot like this, I don't want to go any farther than Faris'.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.88,0:20:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish they'd just host it at MayQueen NyanNyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.80,0:20:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not going to host a university lecture at a maid café.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.72,0:20:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If they didn't take attendance, I'd never go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.39,0:20:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.77,0:20:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.23,0:20:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A satellite fell, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.86,0:20:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That again?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.74,0:20:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not going to Radio Kaikan to see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.28,0:21:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's probably too many onlookers to see anything anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.24,0:21:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm reading the reports on @channel
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.37,0:21:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,from the people who went.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.33,0:21:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,"Work Temporarily Canceled."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.50,0:21:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Another giant thread?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.42,0:21:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.17,0:21:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me your cell phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.88,0:21:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.84,0:21:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.63,0:21:19.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a violation of privacy! Denied!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.55,0:21:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent you a message!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.55,0:21:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A message about Makise Kurisu being stabbed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.97,0:21:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, the one from last week?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.52,0:21:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Last week?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.56,0:21:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It was split into three messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.06,0:21:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was spam!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.35,0:21:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.65,0:21:36.36,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\be2\bord1.5\3c&HEEE9E9&\fscx170\fscy163.75\pos(1251,123)}Okabe Rintaro \N\N{\bord0}(No Subject)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.65,0:21:36.36,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\be2\bord1.5\3c&HEEE9E9&\fscx170\fscy163.75\pos(1251,496.5)}Okabe Rintaro \N\N{\bord0}(No Subject)
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.65,0:21:36.36,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\be2\bord1.5\3c&HEEE9E9&\fscx170\fscy163.75\pos(1251,855)}Okabe Rintaro \N\N{\bord0}(No Subject)
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.19,0:21:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Sent on July 23rd, 12:56...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.36,0:21:36.98,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\b1\bord1.5\3c&HEEE9E9&\fscx211.25\fscy138.75\pos(52.5,783)}"Looks like
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.98,0:21:37.61,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\b1\bord1.5\3c&HEEE9E9&\fscx211.25\fscy138.75\pos(52.5,783)}someone stabbed
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.61,0:21:38.07,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\b1\bord1.5\3c&HEEE9E9&\fscx211.25\fscy138.75\pos(52.5,783)}Makise Kurisu."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.61,0:21:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.28,0:21:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Last week... Let me check my sent folder.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.62,0:21:44.66,Sign1,SIGNS MAKE NO SENSE!,0,0,0,,{\pos(196.5,312)\blur1.5\fs45\c&HDBD6D7&}Mayuri \NRe: Upa...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.62,0:21:44.66,Sign1,SIGNS MAKE NO SENSE!,0,0,0,,{\pos(196.5,628.5)\blur1.5\fs45\c&HDBD6D7&}Daru \NLet's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.62,0:21:44.66,Sign1,SIGNS MAKE NO SENSE!,0,0,0,,{\pos(196.5,895.5)\blur1.5\fs45\c&HDBD6D7&}Mayuri \NLook at \Nthis
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.66,0:21:44.83,Sign1,SIGNS MAKE NO SENSE!,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\fs45\c&HDBD6D7&\pos(196.5,304.5)}\NDaru \NLet's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.66,0:21:44.83,Sign1,SIGNS MAKE NO SENSE!,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\fs45\c&HDBD6D7&\pos(196.5,586.5)}Mayuri \NLook at \Nthis
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.66,0:21:44.83,Sign1,SIGNS MAKE NO SENSE!,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\fs45\c&HDBD6D7&\pos(196.5,898.5)}Mayuri \NRe: Don't \Nsell it
